    <string name="notif_generic">Open the chat on your computer</string>
    <string name="notif_rationale">Receive answer and decision alerts for permitted chats, including work started on the computer. “Answer ready” shows only project and chat names, never answer text. When the agent asks a question, “Agent needs your decision” shows the question text while the phone is unlocked and only the chat name on the lock screen. Monitoring uses a persistent notification and battery power.</string>
    <string name="notif_restart">To alert you with “Answer ready” and “Agent needs your decision”, the app keeps a background connection to your computer. Android requires a persistent notification for it; that notification is silent and has minimal priority. There is no automatic start after the phone restarts: open the app to reconnect. Alerts may be delayed in Doze or while the computer is offline.</string>
    <string name="notif_unsupported">This host does not support notifications yet. Refresh the connection after upgrading it.</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked">Notifications could not be enabled. Check notification access and system restrictions, then try again.</string>
    <string name="notif_unsynced">Local preferences saved; waiting for host synchronization.</string>
    <string name="notif_system">System notification settings</string>
    <string name="notif_battery">Battery optimization settings</string>
    <string name="notif_oneplus">OnePlus: allow background activity and check sleep/standby optimization in system settings. These settings do not guarantee delivery after force stop.</string>
